flowchart TD
    A[Tool call] --> OK{OpenRouter key set?}
    OK -->|no| B{model= provided?}
    OK -->|yes| OM{model= provided?}
    OM -->|"author/model"| OP[OpenRouter, id as given]
    OM -->|"flash / flash-lite / pro / gemini-*"| B
    OM -->|omitted| OD[configured openrouter.default_model<br/>else live free default]
    OD --> OP
    OP --> OE{"terminal 429 / 503 / gated<br/>on a :free model?"}
    OE -->|no| J
    OE -->|yes| OF[next free candidate, once]
    OF --> J
    OE -->|"paid model: never switches"| X
    B -->|yes| C{alias?<br/>flash / flash-lite / pro / *-latest}
    B -->|no| D{default_model set?}
    D -->|yes| C
    D -->|no| F[newest Flash<br/>pinned id if list unreadable]
    C -->|yes| E[newest of that family<br/>pinned id if list unreadable]
    C -->|no| G[concrete id as given]
    E --> H[choose thinking parameter<br/>from concrete id]
    F --> H
    G --> H
    H --> I{503 / 429 after retries?}
    I -->|no| J[return response]
    I -->|yes, model != fallback,<br/>no files written| K[retry once on<br/>newest Flash-Lite]
    I -->|yes, files written<br/>or already the fallback| X["[sidekick error]"]
    K -->|ok| L[return response<br/>+ notice]
    K -->|fails| X
